'''Hard Hosts''' behave similarly to regular Hosts, however instead of firing any shots when they lift their skull, they slam down and fire a tremor towards Isaac. The tremor will destroy most obstacles and damage most monsters in its path. They also deal damage on contact. If Isaac is too close to a Hard Host when it slams down he will be knocked back.
{{clear}}

