== Trivia ==
* Hosts originated from a multiplayer flash game created by Edmund McMillen called ''HOST''.
* Hosts are very similar to the Met enemies from the ''[[wikipedia:Mega Man|Mega Man]]'' series. Both are immune to any kind of damage when they are lowered down, and when they pop up, they become vulnerable and shoot three shots.
** Additionally, Mobile Hosts behave like the Neo Met, a version of the Met that walks after shooting.
* {{e|The Gate}} physically resembles a giant Host.
* {{dlc|a}} In the game's files, Red Hosts and their walking variations have grimace animations that are impossible to see in-game because they are always vulnerable.
** {{dlc|r}} When {{i|Mom's Bracelet|n}} is used on a Host/Mobile Host, the resulting Red Host/Flesh Mobile Host will use its respective grimace animation.
* {{dlc|r}} Using {{i|Mom's Bracelet|n}} on a Host/Mobile Host will transform it into a Red Host/Flesh Mobile Host.
** {{dlc|r}} A Mobile Host's body won't change color when transformed.
* {{dlc|r}} [[Anti:Floating Host|Floasts]] and [[Anti:Hard Host|Hard Hosts]] originate from the ''Antibirth'' mod. In ''Antibirth'', Floasts used be to called Floating Hosts.
* {{dlc|r}} The Floast's name is a reference to [[theendisnigh:Enemies|a monster of the same name]] from ''The End is Nigh''.

